      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "Welcome to Truthward.",
          "start": 3.0,
          "dur": 2.975,
          "abs_start": 3.0
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "This is a calm place for loud questions.",
          "start": 6.425,
          "dur": 4.575,
          "abs_start": 6.425
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "The ones we are usually too busy to sit with.",
          "start": 11.45,
          "dur": 4.7,
          "abs_start": 11.45
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "We will take them slowly, one at a time.",
          "start": 16.6,
          "dur": 4.6,
          "abs_start": 16.6
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "We will be honest about what we find, and honest about what we do not.",
          "start": 21.65,
          "dur": 6.775,
          "abs_start": 21.65
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "There is no rush here.",
          "start": 28.875,
          "dur": 2.9,
          "abs_start": 28.875
        },
        {
          "i": 6,
          "text": "So take a breath.",
          "start": 32.225,
          "dur": 2.725,
          "abs_start": 32.225
        },
        {
          "i": 7,
          "text": "And let us begin.",
          "start": 35.4,
          "dur": 2.5,
          "abs_start": 35.4
        }
      ],
      "beats": [],
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "scene": 1,
      "tone": "rustig",
      "wav": "assets/channels/channel1/voice/chose/man/01.wav",
      "start": 38.5,
      "dur": 61.375,
      "speech_start": 0.0,
      "speech_end": 60.925,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "Start with something simple.",
          "start": 0.0,
          "dur": 3.15,
          "abs_start": 38.5
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "Something that is quietly true about you.",
          "start": 3.6,
          "dur": 4.075,
          "abs_start": 42.1
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "You can think.",
          "start": 8.125,
          "dur": 2.1,
          "abs_start": 46.625
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "A bird does not decide to fly south.",
          "start": 10.675,
          "dur": 4.375,
          "abs_start": 49.175
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "It is born with the answer already inside it.",
          "start": 15.5,
          "dur": 4.775,
          "abs_start": 54.0
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "Where to go.",
          "start": 20.725,
          "dur": 1.875,
          "abs_start": 59.225
        },
        {
          "i": 6,
          "text": "What to eat.",
          "start": 23.05,
          "dur": 1.9,
          "abs_start": 61.55
        },
        {
          "i": 7,
          "text": "What to fear.",
          "start": 25.4,
          "dur": 2.075,
          "abs_start": 63.9
        },
        {
          "i": 8,
          "text": "It never has to wonder.",
          "start": 27.925,
          "dur": 3.3,
          "abs_start": 66.425
        },
        {
          "i": 9,
          "text": "You are not like that.",
          "start": 31.675,
          "dur": 2.6,
          "abs_start": 70.175
        },
        {
          "i": 10,
          "text": "You wake up in front of choices that nothing prepared you for.",
          "start": 34.725,
          "dur": 5.75,
          "abs_start": 73.225
        },
        {
          "i": 11,
          "text": "And you have to work them out for yourself.",
          "start": 40.925,
          "dur": 3.725,
          "abs_start": 79.425
        },
        {
          "i": 12,
          "text": "You weigh things.",
          "start": 45.1,
          "dur": 2.4,
          "abs_start": 83.6
        },
        {
          "i": 13,
          "text": "You reason.",
          "start": 47.95,
          "dur": 2.025,
          "abs_start": 86.45
        },
        {
          "i": 14,
          "text": "You choose.",
          "start": 50.425,
          "dur": 2.0,
          "abs_start": 88.925
        },
        {
          "i": 15,
          "text": "That is a quiet kind of miracle.",
          "start": 52.875,
          "dur": 3.775,
          "abs_start": 91.375
        },
        {
          "i": 16,
          "text": "And you do it every single day.",
          "start": 57.1,
          "dur": 3.825,
          "abs_start": 95.6
        }
      ],
      "beats": [],
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "scene": 2,
      "tone": "rustig",
      "wav": "assets/channels/channel1/voice/chose/man/02.wav",
      "start": 99.875,
      "dur": 34.7,
      "speech_start": 0.0,
      "speech_end": 34.25,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "Most of the time you do not even notice it.",
          "start": 0.0,
          "dur": 4.65,
          "abs_start": 99.875
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "You look up at the sky, and you take a coat.",
          "start": 5.1,
          "dur": 4.4,
          "abs_start": 104.975
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "Such a small thing.",
          "start": 9.95,
          "dur": 2.875,
          "abs_start": 109.825
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "But look a little closer.",
          "start": 13.275,
          "dur": 3.175,
          "abs_start": 113.15
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "You read the world.",
          "start": 16.9,
          "dur": 2.65,
          "abs_start": 116.775
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "You weighed it.",
          "start": 20.0,
          "dur": 2.0,
          "abs_start": 119.875
        },
        {
          "i": 6,
          "text": "And you made a choice.",
          "start": 22.45,
          "dur": 3.1,
          "abs_start": 122.325
        },
        {
          "i": 7,
          "text": "You do that a thousand times a day.",
          "start": 26.0,
          "dur": 4.35,
          "abs_start": 125.875
        },
        {
          "i": 8,
          "text": "You just never call it thinking.",
          "start": 30.8,
          "dur": 3.45,
          "abs_start": 130.675
        }
      ],
      "beats": [],
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "scene": 3,
      "tone": "nadruk",
      "wav": "assets/channels/channel1/voice/chose/man/03.wav",
      "start": 134.575,
      "dur": 58.075,
      "speech_start": 0.0,
      "speech_end": 57.375,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "And when something truly matters, you become even more careful.",
          "start": 0.0,
          "dur": 6.25,
          "abs_start": 134.575
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "A pain comes, and it does not go away.",
          "start": 6.7,
          "dur": 4.6,
          "abs_start": 141.275
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "You do not guess.",
          "start": 11.75,
          "dur": 2.45,
          "abs_start": 146.325
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "You do not open yourself up on the kitchen table.",
          "start": 14.65,
          "dur": 5.075,
          "abs_start": 149.225
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "You stop, and you think.",
          "start": 20.175,
          "dur": 3.2,
          "abs_start": 154.75
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "I do not know enough about this.",
          "start": 23.825,
          "dur": 3.85,
          "abs_start": 158.4
        },
        {
          "i": 6,
          "text": "So I will go to someone who does.",
          "start": 28.125,
          "dur": 4.3,
          "abs_start": 162.7
        },
        {
          "i": 7,
          "text": "Sit with that for a moment.",
          "start": 32.875,
          "dur": 3.525,
          "abs_start": 167.45
        },
        {
          "i": 8,
          "text": "You saw the edge of your own knowing.",
          "start": 38.05,
          "dur": 4.3,
          "abs_start": 172.625
        },
        {
          "i": 9,
          "text": "And you walked toward the person who could see further.",
          "start": 42.8,
          "dur": 4.925,
          "abs_start": 177.375
        },
        {
          "i": 10,
          "text": "That is not weakness.",
          "start": 48.175,
          "dur": 2.9,
          "abs_start": 182.75
        },
        {
          "i": 11,
          "text": "That is the most rational thing a human being can do.",
          "start": 51.525,
          "dur": 5.85,
          "abs_start": 186.1
        }
      ],
      "beats": [],
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "scene": 4,
      "tone": "rustig",
      "wav": "assets/channels/channel1/voice/chose/man/04.wav",
      "start": 192.65,
      "dur": 50.175,
      "speech_start": 0.0,
      "speech_end": 49.725,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "And it is everywhere, once you notice it.",
          "start": 0.0,
          "dur": 4.325,
          "abs_start": 192.65
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "You do not argue your own case in court on a feeling.",
          "start": 4.775,
          "dur": 5.65,
          "abs_start": 197.425
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "You find someone who knows the law.",
          "start": 10.875,
          "dur": 4.05,
          "abs_start": 203.525
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "You do not trust a bridge because it looks strong.",
          "start": 15.375,
          "dur": 4.75,
          "abs_start": 208.025
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "Someone spent years proving that it holds.",
          "start": 20.575,
          "dur": 4.225,
          "abs_start": 213.225
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "The pattern never changes.",
          "start": 25.25,
          "dur": 3.525,
          "abs_start": 217.9
        },
        {
          "i": 6,
          "text": "You look first.",
          "start": 29.225,
          "dur": 2.125,
          "abs_start": 221.875
        },
        {
          "i": 7,
          "text": "You decide after.",
          "start": 31.8,
          "dur": 2.825,
          "abs_start": 224.45
        },
        {
          "i": 8,
          "text": "To simply accept something, handed to you, without ever once checking.",
          "start": 35.075,
          "dur": 6.75,
          "abs_start": 227.725
        },
        {
          "i": 9,
          "text": "That would be reckless.",
          "start": 42.275,
          "dur": 2.6,
          "abs_start": 234.925
        },
        {
          "i": 10,
          "text": "And somewhere inside, you already know it.",
          "start": 45.325,
          "dur": 4.4,
          "abs_start": 237.975
        }
      ],
      "beats": [],
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "scene": 5,
      "tone": "nadruk",
      "wav": "assets/channels/channel1/voice/chose/man/05.wav",
      "start": 242.825,
      "dur": 35.1,
      "speech_start": 0.0,
      "speech_end": 34.4,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "Except in one place.",
          "start": 0.0,
          "dur": 3.2,
          "abs_start": 242.825
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "There is a single question where all of that quietly stops.",
          "start": 4.65,
          "dur": 5.8,
          "abs_start": 247.475
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "And it is not a small one.",
          "start": 10.9,
          "dur": 3.8,
          "abs_start": 253.725
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "It is the largest question there is.",
          "start": 15.15,
          "dur": 3.9,
          "abs_start": 257.975
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "Larger than your health.",
          "start": 20.5,
          "dur": 2.975,
          "abs_start": 263.325
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "Larger than your money.",
          "start": 23.925,
          "dur": 2.95,
          "abs_start": 266.75
        },
        {
          "i": 6,
          "text": "Larger than anything you will ever stand up in a court to defend.",
          "start": 27.325,
          "dur": 7.075,
          "abs_start": 270.15
        }
      ],
      "beats": [],
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "scene": 6,
      "tone": "nadruk",
      "wav": "assets/channels/channel1/voice/chose/man/06.wav",
      "start": 277.925,
      "dur": 69.5,
      "speech_start": 0.0,
      "speech_end": 68.8,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "Here it is.",
          "start": 0.0,
          "dur": 2.15,
          "abs_start": 277.925
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "Why are you here.",
          "start": 3.4,
          "dur": 2.65,
          "abs_start": 281.325
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "What is this.",
          "start": 8.5,
          "dur": 2.2,
          "abs_start": 286.425
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "What happens when it all ends.",
          "start": 13.15,
          "dur": 3.5,
          "abs_start": 291.075
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "Stay with those for a moment.",
          "start": 19.6,
          "dur": 3.675,
          "abs_start": 297.525
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "Do not rush past them.",
          "start": 23.725,
          "dur": 3.1,
          "abs_start": 301.65
        },
        {
          "i": 6,
          "text": "Because this is the question that everything else is standing on.",
          "start": 28.475,
          "dur": 6.7,
          "abs_start": 306.4
        },
        {
          "i": 7,
          "text": "And on this one, the largest of them all, most people never looked.",
          "start": 35.625,
          "dur": 6.35,
          "abs_start": 313.55
        },
        {
          "i": 8,
          "text": "Not once.",
          "start": 42.425,
          "dur": 2.075,
          "abs_start": 320.35
        },
        {
          "i": 9,
          "text": "They did not weigh it.",
          "start": 44.95,
          "dur": 2.675,
          "abs_start": 322.875
        },
        {
          "i": 10,
          "text": "They did not go to anyone who might know.",
          "start": 48.075,
          "dur": 4.35,
          "abs_start": 326.0
        },
        {
          "i": 11,
          "text": "They simply have an answer.",
          "start": 52.875,
          "dur": 3.625,
          "abs_start": 330.8
        },
        {
          "i": 12,
          "text": "And if you ask them, gently, where that answer came from.",
          "start": 58.15,
          "dur": 5.75,
          "abs_start": 336.075
        },
        {
          "i": 13,
          "text": "The room goes quiet.",
          "start": 65.55,
          "dur": 3.25,
          "abs_start": 343.475
        }
      ],
      "beats": [],
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "scene": 7,
      "tone": "warm",
      "wav": "assets/channels/channel1/voice/chose/man/07.wav",
      "start": 347.425,
      "dur": 65.4,
      "speech_start": 0.0,
      "speech_end": 64.55,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "And I want to be honest with you.",
          "start": 0.0,
          "dur": 3.875,
          "abs_start": 347.425
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "I am not saying this to look down on anyone.",
          "start": 4.325,
          "dur": 5.0,
          "abs_start": 351.75
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "I am saying it because it was me.",
          "start": 9.775,
          "dur": 4.15,
          "abs_start": 357.2
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "I had my answer too.",
          "start": 14.375,
          "dur": 3.225,
          "abs_start": 361.8
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "I carried it for years, as if it were mine.",
          "start": 18.05,
          "dur": 4.875,
          "abs_start": 365.475
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "As if I had earned it.",
          "start": 23.375,
          "dur": 3.325,
          "abs_start": 370.8
        },
        {
          "i": 6,
          "text": "Until one quiet day, I asked myself a simple thing.",
          "start": 27.15,
          "dur": 6.25,
          "abs_start": 374.575
        },
        {
          "i": 7,
          "text": "When did I ever sit down with the biggest question there is, and do what I would do for a crack in the wall.",
          "start": 33.85,
          "dur": 10.025,
          "abs_start": 381.275
        },
        {
          "i": 8,
          "text": "Look into it, before I trust it.",
          "start": 44.325,
          "dur": 4.05,
          "abs_start": 391.75
        },
        {
          "i": 9,
          "text": "And the honest answer was, never.",
          "start": 48.825,
          "dur": 4.175,
          "abs_start": 396.25
        },
        {
          "i": 10,
          "text": "Not once.",
          "start": 53.45,
          "dur": 2.075,
          "abs_start": 400.875
        },
        {
          "i": 11,
          "text": "It had been handed to me.",
          "start": 55.975,
          "dur": 3.025,
          "abs_start": 403.4
        },
        {
          "i": 12,
          "text": "And I had spent my whole life calling it my own.",
          "start": 59.45,
          "dur": 5.1,
          "abs_start": 406.875
        }
      ],
      "beats": [],
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "scene": 8,
      "tone": "rustig",
      "wav": "assets/channels/channel1/voice/chose/man/08.wav",
      "start": 412.825,
      "dur": 101.725,
      "speech_start": 0.0,
      "speech_end": 101.275,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "So I began to pay attention.",
          "start": 0.0,
          "dur": 4.025,
          "abs_start": 412.825
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "If people did not reason their way to this answer, then where did it come from.",
          "start": 4.475,
          "dur": 6.7,
          "abs_start": 417.3
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "And as far as I can tell, it arrives through five quiet doors.",
          "start": 11.625,
          "dur": 6.25,
          "abs_start": 424.45
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "The first is home.",
          "start": 18.325,
          "dur": 2.9,
          "abs_start": 431.15
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "Your parents believed something, or they believed in nothing.",
          "start": 21.675,
          "dur": 5.6,
          "abs_start": 434.5
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "And it was yours before you could even speak.",
          "start": 27.725,
          "dur": 4.325,
          "abs_start": 440.55
        },
        {
          "i": 6,
          "text": "The second is a single moment.",
          "start": 32.5,
          "dur": 4.05,
          "abs_start": 445.325
        },
        {
          "i": 7,
          "text": "Something happened that you could not explain.",
          "start": 37.0,
          "dur": 4.475,
          "abs_start": 449.825
        },
        {
          "i": 8,
          "text": "You took it as proof.",
          "start": 41.925,
          "dur": 2.95,
          "abs_start": 454.75
        },
        {
          "i": 9,
          "text": "And you never went back to it.",
          "start": 45.325,
          "dur": 3.025,
          "abs_start": 458.15
        },
        {
          "i": 10,
          "text": "The third is the people around you.",
          "start": 48.8,
          "dur": 4.0,
          "abs_start": 461.625
        },
        {
          "i": 11,
          "text": "Everyone leaned one way.",
          "start": 53.25,
          "dur": 3.5,
          "abs_start": 466.075
        },
        {
          "i": 12,
          "text": "And leaning with them was easier than standing alone.",
          "start": 57.2,
          "dur": 5.35,
          "abs_start": 470.025
        },
        {
          "i": 13,
          "text": "The fourth is the world itself.",
          "start": 63.0,
          "dur": 3.75,
          "abs_start": 475.825
        },
        {
          "i": 14,
          "text": "The films, the songs, the things that school handed you as simply true.",
          "start": 67.2,
          "dur": 6.9,
          "abs_start": 480.025
        },
        {
          "i": 15,
          "text": "A thousand gentle pushes that you never felt as pushes.",
          "start": 74.55,
          "dur": 6.1,
          "abs_start": 487.375
        },
        {
          "i": 16,
          "text": "And the fifth is pain.",
          "start": 81.1,
          "dur": 3.075,
          "abs_start": 493.925
        },
        {
          "i": 17,
          "text": "Someone hurt you in the name of their answer.",
          "start": 84.625,
          "dur": 4.5,
          "abs_start": 497.45
        },
        {
          "i": 18,
          "text": "So you took the opposite one.",
          "start": 89.575,
          "dur": 3.3,
          "abs_start": 502.4
        },
        {
          "i": 19,
          "text": "Not because you weighed it.",
          "start": 93.325,
          "dur": 3.025,
          "abs_start": 506.15
        },
        {
          "i": 20,
          "text": "But because you were walking away from them.",
          "start": 96.8,
          "dur": 4.475,
          "abs_start": 509.625
        }
      ],
      "beats": [],
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "scene": 9,
      "tone": "nadruk",
      "wav": "assets/channels/channel1/voice/chose/man/09.wav",
      "start": 514.55,
      "dur": 47.925,
      "speech_start": 0.0,
      "speech_end": 47.225,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "Now look at those five, honestly.",
          "start": 0.0,
          "dur": 4.0,
          "abs_start": 514.55
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "Four of them are something arriving from outside you.",
          "start": 4.45,
          "dur": 5.275,
          "abs_start": 519.0
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "One of them is you pushing something away.",
          "start": 10.175,
          "dur": 4.575,
          "abs_start": 524.725
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "And not a single one of them is you, sitting down, and reasoning it through.",
          "start": 15.2,
          "dur": 7.375,
          "abs_start": 529.75
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "And yet, for most people, this is how they came to hold the most important thing they believe.",
          "start": 24.225,
          "dur": 8.7,
          "abs_start": 538.775
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "One person swallowed it whole.",
          "start": 33.375,
          "dur": 3.7,
          "abs_start": 547.925
        },
        {
          "i": 6,
          "text": "The next spat it out just as fast.",
          "start": 37.525,
          "dur": 4.15,
          "abs_start": 552.075
        },
        {
          "i": 7,
          "text": "And both of them were certain that they had chosen.",
          "start": 42.125,
          "dur": 5.1,
          "abs_start": 556.675
        }
      ],
      "beats": [],
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "scene": 10,
      "tone": "nadruk",
      "wav": "assets/channels/channel1/voice/chose/man/10.wav",
      "start": 562.475,
      "dur": 100.15,
      "speech_start": 0.0,
      "speech_end": 99.45,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "Now you might be thinking.",
          "start": 0.0,
          "dur": 3.25,
          "abs_start": 562.475
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "Fine.",
          "start": 3.7,
          "dur": 1.7,
          "abs_start": 566.175
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "I was a child.",
          "start": 5.85,
          "dur": 3.025,
          "abs_start": 568.325
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "I did not choose it back then.",
          "start": 9.325,
          "dur": 3.55,
          "abs_start": 571.8
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "But I am grown now.",
          "start": 13.325,
          "dur": 3.325,
          "abs_start": 575.8
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "If it were wrong, I would have gone back, and checked.",
          "start": 17.1,
          "dur": 4.925,
          "abs_start": 579.575
        },
        {
          "i": 6,
          "text": "And here is the uncomfortable part.",
          "start": 22.475,
          "dur": 4.35,
          "abs_start": 584.95
        },
        {
          "i": 7,
          "text": "Most of us never do.",
          "start": 27.275,
          "dur": 3.375,
          "abs_start": 589.75
        },
        {
          "i": 8,
          "text": "And it is not because we are not clever enough.",
          "start": 32.1,
          "dur": 5.025,
          "abs_start": 594.575
        },
        {
          "i": 9,
          "text": "It is that, by now, the answer is not just an idea that you hold.",
          "start": 37.575,
          "dur": 6.75,
          "abs_start": 600.05
        },
        {
          "i": 10,
          "text": "It has become a part of who you are.",
          "start": 44.775,
          "dur": 4.275,
          "abs_start": 607.25
        },
        {
          "i": 11,
          "text": "It is woven into the people you belong to.",
          "start": 49.5,
          "dur": 5.1,
          "abs_start": 611.975
        },
        {
          "i": 12,
          "text": "And when something sits that close to you, you do not test it.",
          "start": 55.05,
          "dur": 5.825,
          "abs_start": 617.525
        },
        {
          "i": 13,
          "text": "You protect it.",
          "start": 61.325,
          "dur": 2.375,
          "abs_start": 623.8
        },
        {
          "i": 14,
          "text": "You take that same sharp mind that chooses the right doctor, and you turn it around.",
          "start": 65.15,
          "dur": 8.025,
          "abs_start": 627.625
        },
        {
          "i": 15,
          "text": "You use it to defend your answer, instead of examining it.",
          "start": 73.625,
          "dur": 6.425,
          "abs_start": 636.1
        },
        {
          "i": 16,
          "text": "That is the strange thing.",
          "start": 80.5,
          "dur": 3.275,
          "abs_start": 642.975
        },
        {
          "i": 17,
          "text": "The sharper the mind, the better it becomes at defending.",
          "start": 84.225,
          "dur": 5.7,
          "abs_start": 646.7
        },
        {
          "i": 18,
          "text": "It is not the careless who are most stuck here.",
          "start": 90.375,
          "dur": 4.55,
          "abs_start": 652.85
        },
        {
          "i": 19,
          "text": "Very often, it is the brightest.",
          "start": 95.375,
          "dur": 4.075,
          "abs_start": 657.85
        }
      ],
      "beats": [],
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "scene": 11,
      "tone": "nadruk",
      "wav": "assets/channels/channel1/voice/chose/man/11.wav",
      "start": 662.625,
      "dur": 107.0,
      "speech_start": 0.0,
      "speech_end": 106.3,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "So.",
          "start": 0.0,
          "dur": 1.525,
          "abs_start": 662.625
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "Why does the thinking creature stop thinking, right here, on the one question that matters most.",
          "start": 2.775,
          "dur": 8.7,
          "abs_start": 665.4
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "I promised you an answer.",
          "start": 11.925,
          "dur": 3.575,
          "abs_start": 674.55
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "So here it is, plainly.",
          "start": 15.95,
          "dur": 3.275,
          "abs_start": 678.575
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "It is not because people are foolish.",
          "start": 20.675,
          "dur": 4.275,
          "abs_start": 683.3
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "It is that an answer was already waiting for them.",
          "start": 25.4,
          "dur": 5.425,
          "abs_start": 688.025
        },
        {
          "i": 6,
          "text": "Through one of those five doors, something was always filled in, long before they arrived.",
          "start": 31.275,
          "dur": 8.275,
          "abs_start": 693.9
        },
        {
          "i": 7,
          "text": "There was never a blank page in front of them, asking to be filled.",
          "start": 40.0,
          "dur": 6.675,
          "abs_start": 702.625
        },
        {
          "i": 8,
          "text": "And the one time they might have gone back to check.",
          "start": 47.125,
          "dur": 4.775,
          "abs_start": 709.75
        },
        {
          "i": 9,
          "text": "The answer had already become a part of them.",
          "start": 52.35,
          "dur": 5.175,
          "abs_start": 714.975
        },
        {
          "i": 10,
          "text": "So they guarded it, instead.",
          "start": 57.975,
          "dur": 3.675,
          "abs_start": 720.6
        },
        {
          "i": 11,
          "text": "That is the answer.",
          "start": 62.1,
          "dur": 2.875,
          "abs_start": 724.725
        },
        {
          "i": 12,
          "text": "And I will be honest about my own.",
          "start": 66.925,
          "dur": 4.375,
          "abs_start": 729.55
        },
        {
          "i": 13,
          "text": "These are the five doors that I could find.",
          "start": 71.75,
          "dur": 5.025,
          "abs_start": 734.375
        },
        {
          "i": 14,
          "text": "Maybe you can find a sixth.",
          "start": 77.225,
          "dur": 3.875,
          "abs_start": 739.85
        },
        {
          "i": 15,
          "text": "They are not carved in stone, just because they came out of my head.",
          "start": 81.55,
          "dur": 6.45,
          "abs_start": 744.175
        },
        {
          "i": 16,
          "text": "That is the whole point of this.",
          "start": 88.45,
          "dur": 3.7,
          "abs_start": 751.075
        },
        {
          "i": 17,
          "text": "But look at them, honestly.",
          "start": 92.6,
          "dur": 3.4,
          "abs_start": 755.225
        },
        {
          "i": 18,
          "text": "And ask yourself.",
          "start": 96.45,
          "dur": 2.75,
          "abs_start": 759.075
        },
        {
          "i": 19,
          "text": "Is even one of them a reason to be sure of anything.",
          "start": 100.65,
          "dur": 5.65,
          "abs_start": 763.275
        }
      ],
      "beats": [],
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "scene": 12,
      "tone": "warm",
      "wav": "assets/channels/channel1/voice/chose/man/12.wav",
      "start": 769.625,
      "dur": 132.45,
      "speech_start": 0.0,
      "speech_end": 131.6,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "And this is where it begins to itch.",
          "start": 0.0,
          "dur": 4.15,
          "abs_start": 769.625
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "If your answer to the largest question did not come from you.",
          "start": 4.6,
          "dur": 6.15,
          "abs_start": 774.225
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "But from where you happened to be born.",
          "start": 11.2,
          "dur": 3.8,
          "abs_start": 780.825
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "And who raised you.",
          "start": 15.45,
          "dur": 2.775,
          "abs_start": 785.075
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "And what once hurt you.",
          "start": 18.675,
          "dur": 2.775,
          "abs_start": 788.3
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "Then how could you ever really know if it is true.",
          "start": 21.9,
          "dur": 5.175,
          "abs_start": 791.525
        },
        {
          "i": 6,
          "text": "Most people never reach that question.",
          "start": 28.725,
          "dur": 4.375,
          "abs_start": 798.35
        },
        {
          "i": 7,
          "text": "But most is not all.",
          "start": 33.55,
          "dur": 3.25,
          "abs_start": 803.175
        },
        {
          "i": 8,
          "text": "Some people do go back.",
          "start": 37.25,
          "dur": 3.15,
          "abs_start": 806.875
        },
        {
          "i": 9,
          "text": "Some do sit down with it.",
          "start": 40.85,
          "dur": 3.325,
          "abs_start": 810.475
        },
        {
          "i": 10,
          "text": "That is the only reason anyone has ever changed their mind about anything.",
          "start": 44.625,
          "dur": 7.775,
          "abs_start": 814.25
        },
        {
          "i": 11,
          "text": "So maybe you are one of the ones who looks.",
          "start": 52.85,
          "dur": 4.7,
          "abs_start": 822.475
        },
        {
          "i": 12,
          "text": "This time.",
          "start": 58.0,
          "dur": 2.025,
          "abs_start": 827.625
        },
        {
          "i": 13,
          "text": "And the moment you try, something stands in the doorway.",
          "start": 60.475,
          "dur": 5.425,
          "abs_start": 830.1
        },
        {
          "i": 14,
          "text": "A quiet voice that says.",
          "start": 66.35,
          "dur": 3.375,
          "abs_start": 835.975
        },
        {
          "i": 15,
          "text": "Who cares.",
          "start": 70.175,
          "dur": 2.15,
          "abs_start": 839.8
        },
        {
          "i": 16,
          "text": "It is all just opinion anyway.",
          "start": 72.775,
          "dur": 4.125,
          "abs_start": 842.4
        },
        {
          "i": 17,
          "text": "Your truth.",
          "start": 77.35,
          "dur": 2.025,
          "abs_start": 846.975
        },
        {
          "i": 18,
          "text": "My truth.",
          "start": 79.825,
          "dur": 2.125,
          "abs_start": 849.45
        },
        {
          "i": 19,
          "text": "No one is really right.",
          "start": 82.4,
          "dur": 3.275,
          "abs_start": 852.025
        },
        {
          "i": 20,
          "text": "And if that is true, then this whole thing is pointless.",
          "start": 86.125,
          "dur": 5.45,
          "abs_start": 855.75
        },
        {
          "i": 21,
          "text": "So before we go anywhere near what the answer might be, we have to sit with that one first.",
          "start": 92.025,
          "dur": 8.5,
          "abs_start": 861.65
        },
        {
          "i": 22,
          "text": "Is there such a thing as a truth that stays true.",
          "start": 100.975,
          "dur": 5.5,
          "abs_start": 870.6
        },
        {
          "i": 23,
          "text": "Whether you believe it or not.",
          "start": 108.125,
          "dur": 3.7,
          "abs_start": 877.75
        },
        {
          "i": 24,
          "text": "Or is all of it just opinion.",
          "start": 112.275,
          "dur": 3.9,
          "abs_start": 881.9
        },
        {
          "i": 25,
          "text": "Until we have looked at that, honestly, nothing else we say has any ground to stand on.",
          "start": 116.625,
          "dur": 8.45,
          "abs_start": 886.25
        },
        {
          "i": 26,
          "text": "And that.",
          "start": 125.525,
          "dur": 1.925,
          "abs_start": 895.15
        },
        {
          "i": 27,
          "text": "Is where we go next.",
          "start": 128.7,
          "dur": 2.9,
          "abs_start": 898.325
        }
      ],
      "beats": [],
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "scene": 13,
      "tone": "outro",
      "wav": "assets/channels/channel1/voice/chose/man/13.wav",
      "start": 902.075,
      "dur": 42.1,
      "speech_start": 0.0,
      "speech_end": 41.3,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "If this gave you something to sit with tonight, then stay with us.",
          "start": 0.0,
          "dur": 6.125,
          "abs_start": 902.075
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "We take one honest question at a time, slowly, and we follow it wherever it leads.",
          "start": 6.575,
          "dur": 7.75,
          "abs_start": 908.65
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "No preaching.",
          "start": 14.775,
          "dur": 2.325,
          "abs_start": 916.85
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "No noise.",
          "start": 17.55,
          "dur": 2.1,
          "abs_start": 919.625
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "Just an honest look.",
          "start": 20.1,
          "dur": 2.85,
          "abs_start": 922.175
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "Subscribe, so that the next one finds you.",
          "start": 23.4,
          "dur": 4.675,
          "abs_start": 925.475
        },
        {
          "i": 6,
          "text": "And the next one asks whether any truth can hold at all, whether you believe it or not.",
          "start": 28.525,
          "dur": 7.85,
          "abs_start": 930.6
        },
        {
          "i": 7,
          "text": "I would be glad to have you there, when we look.",
          "start": 36.825,
          "dur": 4.475,
          "abs_start": 938.9
        }
      ],
      "beats": [],
      "sfx": []
    }
  ]
}